{t: This Is How We Do It}
{st: Montell Jordan}
{key: Fm}
{tempo: 104}

{sot: Intro}
| Fm7   Bbm7  | Ab    Eb    | Fm7   Bbm7  | Ab    Eb    |
{eot}

{sot: Verse}
| Fm7   Bbm7  | Ab    Eb    | Fm7   Bbm7  | Ab    Eb    |
