{sov: Notes}
90s New Jack Swing/Hip-Hop: Anchored by a smooth 4-bar loop in F minor, sampling
Slick Rick's "Children's Story" rhythm track.

Core Progression: Loops Fm7 - Bbm7 - Ab - Eb consistently throughout the entire
track, driving the vocal hooks and party breakdown.

Guitar/Keys Comping: Lay back in the pocket with short, muted 16th-note stabs.
Accent beat 2 and 4 to keep the bounce tight with the kick and snare.

Bass Groove: The synth bass drives the motion with a heavy step down from Ab to Eb
at the end of each two-bar cycle.
{eov}